{"content": "Let's solve the system of equations:\n\n1) \\( 888x + 889y = 890 \\)\n2) \\( 891x + 892y = 893 \\)\n\nLet's subtract equation 1 from equation 2:\n\n\\[\n(891x + 892y) - (888x + 889y) = 893 - 890\n\\]\n\\[\n(891x - 888x) + (892y - 889y) = 3\n\\]\n\\[\n3x + 3y = 3\n\\]\n\\[\nx + y = 1\n\\]\n\nNow, let's use this in equation 1:\n\n\\[\n888x + 889y = 890\n\\]\n\nSince \\( x + y = 1 \\), \\( y = 1 - x \\):\n\n\\[\n888x + 889(1 - x) = 890\n\\]\n\\[\n888x + 889 - 889x = 890\n\\]\n\\[\n(888x - 889x) + 889 = 890\n\\]\n\\[\n-1x + 889 = 890\n\\]\n\\[\n-1x = 1\n\\]\n\\[\nx = -1\n\\]\n\nNow, \\( x + y = 1 \\implies -1 + y = 1 \\implies y = 2 \\).\n\nSo, \\( x - y = -1 - 2 = -3 \\).\n\nAnswer: B", "prompt_tokens": 110, "completion_tokens": 304, "total_tokens": 414, "model": "gpt-4.1"}